# Large binary integrated libraries are stored in Git LFS.
*.IntLib* filter=lfs diff=lfs merge=lfs -text

# NOTE: We do NOT use `lockable` / read-only file locking.
# Altium binary files (.SchLib/.PcbLib/.IntLib) still cannot be text-merged,
# so avoid two people editing the SAME file at once. The auto-sync workflow
# protects you: if an overlap happens, it opens a Pull Request instead of
# overwriting anyone's work. See docs/GIT_WORKFLOW.md.
